WEBVTT

00:00.650 --> 00:02.480
MIKAZUKI TEMPLE

00:07.490 --> 00:08.780
Yuzuki.

00:10.870 --> 00:11.820
I'm back.

00:12.780 --> 00:13.990
Yuzuki, Akagami!

00:15.250 --> 00:16.450
I'm back, Tsukuyo.

00:17.500 --> 00:19.830
You should've told us
if you're staying the night.

00:19.830 --> 00:23.000
Sorry, my phone died.

00:23.340 --> 00:24.920
But it's okay.

00:24.920 --> 00:26.510
Looks like nothing unusual happened.

00:26.840 --> 00:29.090
Yes, nothing happened at all.

00:29.090 --> 00:31.010
Something definitely happened!

00:33.680 --> 00:35.720
WORLDLY DESIRES

00:36.140 --> 00:38.810
TENPURU: NO ONE CAN LIVE ON LONELINESS

02:01.430 --> 02:04.480
EPISODE 5: HOW WILL YOU TAKE RESPONSIBILITY?

02:04.940 --> 02:06.440
Goodbye!

02:09.730 --> 02:12.490
So you missed the last bus yesterday,

02:13.530 --> 02:17.240
went to a love hotel,
but nothing happened?

02:17.240 --> 02:19.370
Yeah! We just slept there!

02:19.370 --> 02:21.040
Really?

02:21.040 --> 02:24.580
I thought you had an affair
on the day of your engagement.

02:24.580 --> 02:26.250
You thought that way?!

02:26.720 --> 02:29.250
But Yuzuki,

02:29.670 --> 02:32.130
you absolutely cannot
tell anyone at school

02:32.130 --> 02:33.590
that Akagami is living with us.

02:33.590 --> 02:38.100
Eh? But isn't it common for
a temple attendant to live in the temple?

02:38.100 --> 02:40.720
It is a nunnery, Yuzuki.

02:40.720 --> 02:42.350
Is it necessary to be so cautious?

02:42.350 --> 02:46.230
Of course! Living with a young man
would harm our reputation...

02:46.230 --> 02:48.770
But if it's Akagami, it's okay, right?

02:48.770 --> 02:51.230
- We went to a love hotel and nothing...
- Yuzuki!

02:51.570 --> 02:52.400
In any case!

02:52.400 --> 02:55.200
The fact that Akagami is living
with us must be kept secret!

02:55.200 --> 02:55.950
Understood?

03:03.910 --> 03:06.580
Gosh, Yuzuki really
has no vigilance at all.

03:07.170 --> 03:09.540
Before Akagami came,
she was more...

03:09.920 --> 03:11.670
She was more...

03:13.380 --> 03:14.300
Tsuki.

03:16.760 --> 03:17.890
Morning.

03:17.890 --> 03:20.050
Mana, Yuki, good morning.

03:20.050 --> 03:22.060
What's up? You look a bit down.

03:22.060 --> 03:24.600
Ah, it's just something at home.

03:25.140 --> 03:26.560
Something at the temple?

03:26.560 --> 03:29.150
Right, speaking of the temple,

03:29.770 --> 03:31.320
I heard you have a boyfriend?

03:34.320 --> 03:36.030
What are you talking about?

03:36.030 --> 03:37.820
I don't!

03:37.820 --> 03:39.620
Somebody saw you.

03:39.620 --> 03:40.780
Saw me?

03:41.220 --> 03:44.290
They saw you kissing a man
by the river after the rain.

03:44.290 --> 03:47.290
And then you went home together!

03:48.330 --> 03:50.710
That must be someone else.

03:50.710 --> 03:54.050
But that man was wearing a monk's robe.

03:54.050 --> 03:55.300
A monk's robe?

03:58.970 --> 04:00.640
Was it then?

04:00.640 --> 04:02.100
No!

04:02.100 --> 04:04.930
And it wasn't just the two of us!
Yuzuki was there too!

04:05.350 --> 04:07.640
Oh, in front of your sister!

04:07.640 --> 04:09.690
I told you it wasn't like that!

04:09.690 --> 04:12.650
- We were just whispering!
- Whispering?

04:13.030 --> 04:14.980
Yes! And the kiss...

04:16.030 --> 04:18.280
You did kiss after all!

04:18.700 --> 04:21.200
- Then he is your boyfriend.
- Tell us more about it.

04:21.200 --> 04:22.660
No!

04:22.990 --> 04:26.080
- This is quite an event.
- Yes, it is.

04:26.660 --> 04:29.460
You are the target of many boys.

04:30.790 --> 04:31.920
What?

04:32.340 --> 04:33.960
Although you don't realize it,

04:33.960 --> 04:37.670
the Aoba sisters are
quite popular in school.

04:37.670 --> 04:40.720
Your sister Yuzuki is
famous for her beauty.

04:41.330 --> 04:42.600
And you...

04:42.600 --> 04:45.010
- You are big.
- Huge.

04:45.390 --> 04:46.520
What are you saying?

04:46.940 --> 04:49.100
The news that you have a boyfriend

04:49.100 --> 04:51.520
is now all the rage.

04:51.520 --> 04:52.520
What?

04:52.520 --> 04:53.980
Tell us about it!

04:53.980 --> 04:55.230
- Tell us about it.
- That's not good.

04:55.230 --> 04:57.280
If they know that I'm living with him,

04:57.280 --> 04:58.900
it's all over...

05:00.910 --> 05:01.910
What's wrong?

05:02.240 --> 05:04.530
- He came to school?
- How vigilant.

05:05.240 --> 05:07.540
And he's wearing a monk's robe.

05:09.660 --> 05:10.920
TSUKUYO'S LUNCH

05:10.920 --> 05:13.420
I was the one who was careless!

05:13.420 --> 05:14.960
I'm going to the infirmary!

05:14.960 --> 05:17.300
- The infirmary?
- And she's sprinting.

05:18.210 --> 05:20.220
Excuse me, which class is Aoba Tsukuyo in?

05:21.590 --> 05:22.970
The Aoba sisters...

05:22.970 --> 05:24.930
Wait, who are you?

05:25.350 --> 05:27.140
Sorry, I didn't introduce myself.

05:27.140 --> 05:29.980
I'm here to deliver lunch to Tsukuyo.

05:29.980 --> 05:31.190
Akagami...

05:41.530 --> 05:43.030
Where am I?

05:43.030 --> 05:44.060
You're awake?

05:46.580 --> 05:48.790
Shh, it's me!

05:49.060 --> 05:51.540
Tsukuyo? What is this...

05:51.960 --> 05:53.330
The infirmary.

05:53.330 --> 05:55.590
The teacher hasn't arrived at this time.

05:55.960 --> 05:58.960
You forgot your lunch box.

05:58.960 --> 06:02.340
Well... Even though I want to thank you...

06:03.090 --> 06:04.650
I've completed my task. See you.

06:05.850 --> 06:08.810
Wait! Gym class is about to begin!

06:08.810 --> 06:10.270
You will be seen!

06:10.270 --> 06:11.480
Is there any problem?

06:11.480 --> 06:14.230
There're many problems!
A monk's robe is too conspicuous!

06:14.620 --> 06:18.270
I don't think a person wearing a monk's robe
in school would be considered suspicious.

06:18.270 --> 06:20.900
This depends on
the timing and location, Akagami.

06:21.650 --> 06:23.450
Anyway, you hide here for now.

06:24.910 --> 06:27.240
No way! The teacher is here?

06:27.240 --> 06:28.530
1-B KANNA, 1-B GEKKA

06:28.530 --> 06:29.910
Excuse us.

06:29.910 --> 06:31.250
Tsuki, are you there?

06:31.250 --> 06:32.370
Hello.

06:34.420 --> 06:35.630
How do you feel?

06:36.960 --> 06:38.840
I lay down for a while
and feel fine now.

06:38.840 --> 06:40.710
Not fine at all!

06:41.130 --> 06:43.130
Why did you come over?

06:43.130 --> 06:45.930
Next is gym class,
we just came by to check on you.

06:45.930 --> 06:49.220
Really? Thanks.
I'm fine now. Don't worry.

06:49.220 --> 06:50.890
Hey, Tsuki.

06:50.890 --> 06:52.520
Why do your legs look so long?

06:53.310 --> 06:55.730
Not good! I have to shrink
into the blanket a bit more...

06:55.730 --> 06:57.940
Not good! I have to move up a bit...

06:59.770 --> 07:00.440
What's wrong?

07:00.820 --> 07:02.650
Leg... leg cramp.

07:03.610 --> 07:05.030
Oh, a cramp.

07:05.030 --> 07:06.950
Yes! It's not a big deal.

07:07.250 --> 07:10.140
Other than the fact that this guy
is getting in my clothes...

07:11.660 --> 07:13.250
The break is about to end.

07:13.250 --> 07:15.330
You should go to class.

07:15.330 --> 07:17.580
Yeah, we should go.

07:17.580 --> 07:20.290
Hey, Tsuki, did you get fat?

07:21.050 --> 07:22.590
It must be your imagination.

07:24.090 --> 07:26.680
I didn't get fat at all!

07:26.680 --> 07:27.590
She's gonna cry!

07:27.930 --> 07:30.600
- Please go, please.
- Sorry.

07:30.970 --> 07:32.850
I'm suffocating.

07:33.690 --> 07:35.690
If I don't breathe...

07:38.310 --> 07:39.810
What...

07:40.360 --> 07:41.820
What did he do?

07:43.400 --> 07:46.280
Tsuki, listen to me.

07:46.700 --> 07:49.300
You're still not going back
to the archery club?

07:50.240 --> 07:51.910
The competition is coming soon.

07:51.910 --> 07:54.290
Everyone misses you.

07:57.330 --> 08:00.210
Sorry, I'm really busy at home.

08:00.210 --> 08:02.420
Ah, you still can't?

08:02.750 --> 08:05.920
- I'm really sorry.
- It's okay. We don't want to force you.

08:06.300 --> 08:08.090
Well, we'll go now.

08:13.220 --> 08:15.270
I.. I thought I saw nirvana...

08:15.270 --> 08:17.890
This guy took advantage of me.

08:18.690 --> 08:20.980
Tsukuyo, you used to be
in the archery club?

08:21.730 --> 08:23.860
Well... 'used to' is not accurate.

08:24.530 --> 08:26.280
You're not planning to continue?

08:27.110 --> 08:29.360
Right now, I'm... taking a break...

08:31.530 --> 08:35.240
I see. Then let's go through
the procedures to resume it.

08:35.240 --> 08:36.160
Eh...wait...

08:36.160 --> 08:38.870
It's okay. Leave the work at home to me!

08:38.870 --> 08:40.620
Wait a minute, Akagami!

08:43.630 --> 08:45.380
1-B KANNA, 1-B GEKKA
Tsuki, the class after gym

08:45.380 --> 08:47.010
1-B KANNA, 1-B GEKKA
is changed into self-study.

08:53.010 --> 08:57.020
ENTERING THROUGH THE NARROW GATE

09:00.520 --> 09:02.350
I used to admire her posture in archery,

09:02.940 --> 09:06.860
and that dignified face.

09:07.860 --> 09:08.860
I want to get closer, even just a little bit.

09:08.860 --> 09:10.830
CLUB ENTRY APPLICATION 1-B AOBA TSUKUYO
I want to get closer, even just a little bit.

09:11.360 --> 09:12.280
But...

09:12.280 --> 09:14.660
Eh, you are going to
quit the archery club?

09:15.310 --> 09:16.120
Why?

09:16.490 --> 09:19.500
I plan to... inherit this temple.

09:20.330 --> 09:21.460
No way...

09:28.840 --> 09:31.970
Why do I still have this dream?

09:34.890 --> 09:36.810
You worked hard, Akagami.

09:37.260 --> 09:38.640
Good morning.

09:38.640 --> 09:41.230
Eh, is that a bow?

09:41.230 --> 09:44.150
Yes, archery is also called standing Zen.

09:44.610 --> 09:47.730
STANDING ZEN
I heard Buddhist colleges offer related courses.

09:49.570 --> 09:52.150
- Would you like to try, Akagami?
- I would love to!

10:08.590 --> 10:11.670
Tsukuyo is in the archery club, right?

10:11.670 --> 10:14.050
Yes, but she quit.

10:14.470 --> 10:15.680
That's a pity.

10:15.680 --> 10:16.800
Quit?

10:17.510 --> 10:19.520
I remember Tsukuyo said...

10:22.430 --> 10:23.350
Tsukuyo?

10:25.230 --> 10:26.940
She won't open the door.

10:26.940 --> 10:29.190
She's in shut-in mode right now.

10:29.190 --> 10:32.950
Whenever Tsukuyo has something bothering her,
she'll lock herself in her room.

10:32.950 --> 10:34.910
No problem! Leave it to me!

10:45.960 --> 10:48.340
There's no point in
worrying about this now.

10:49.110 --> 10:51.130
Right now I'm... taking a break...

10:52.130 --> 10:55.050
I really have a knack
for giving up halfway.

10:55.840 --> 10:57.640
Tsukuyo!

11:00.060 --> 11:01.600
Tsukuyo!

11:01.600 --> 11:03.560
Can I take a bit of your time?

11:05.060 --> 11:06.730
I have a few words to say to you.

11:11.730 --> 11:13.110
I'm saved.

11:13.110 --> 11:15.150
Just what are you trying to do?

11:15.990 --> 11:19.370
What did you want to say? Say it.

11:19.870 --> 11:23.040
I've already done today's
cooking, washing, and cleaning.

11:23.830 --> 11:26.210
I've also checked
last month's accounts.

11:26.210 --> 11:29.250
I can handle hosting
and answering the phone by myself.

11:30.290 --> 11:32.170
T-Thank you...?

11:32.170 --> 11:33.840
So, Tsukuyo!

11:33.840 --> 11:36.680
You can return to the archery club
without any worries.

11:40.350 --> 11:42.930
- You should do it today...
- Listen, Akagami.

11:44.100 --> 11:46.770
You seem to have misunderstood
something since yesterday.

11:47.390 --> 11:50.150
I don't really want to practice archery.

11:51.520 --> 11:52.860
Is that so?

11:52.860 --> 11:53.480
Hmm.

11:53.940 --> 11:58.200
Then why are you still
on hiatus instead of just quitting?

11:58.200 --> 12:00.780
It seems like you're preparing
to return at any time.

12:02.200 --> 12:04.660
I feel a bit breathless.
I'll go out for a walk.

12:07.000 --> 12:09.500
I'll leave the rest
of the work to you, Akagami.

12:15.050 --> 12:19.010
Akagami... He's always meddling
in other people's business.

12:19.930 --> 12:21.550
What should I do after this?

12:23.060 --> 12:25.220
- Over here.
- Wait for me.

12:33.770 --> 12:37.780
Oh my, how did I end up here?

12:43.910 --> 12:46.640
Oh gosh, they are organizing
this place so carelessly.

12:48.410 --> 12:51.040
This bowstring is tied so badly.

13:07.020 --> 13:07.980
Draw.

13:09.850 --> 13:10.690
Release.

13:15.320 --> 13:16.650
What am I doing?

13:17.440 --> 13:19.650
Bullseye!

13:19.650 --> 13:22.200
Akagami? Why are you here?

13:22.200 --> 13:23.370
Damn!

13:24.620 --> 13:25.410
Tsukuyo?

13:36.670 --> 13:38.050
Why are you running away?

13:40.470 --> 13:41.840
Nothing.

13:41.840 --> 13:44.720
I just don't want others
to see me with you.

13:45.140 --> 13:47.770
Have you made up your mind
to return to the archery club?

13:48.810 --> 13:50.890
I said that I don't want to continue.

13:51.810 --> 13:52.640
But,

13:53.150 --> 13:54.900
Tsukuyo, you look very happy

13:55.320 --> 13:56.820
on the archery field.

14:02.570 --> 14:03.660
Exactly.

14:04.530 --> 14:07.240
I can't... because it just makes me happy...

14:08.990 --> 14:13.420
I'm not particularly talented in archery.

14:13.420 --> 14:14.880
I started practicing archery

14:14.880 --> 14:18.000
because Yuzuki was in the archery club
and I just followed her.

14:22.170 --> 14:24.510
The person who should
continue practicing archery

14:24.510 --> 14:26.680
shouldn't be me, but Yuzuki.

14:27.600 --> 14:29.310
She's more talented than me,

14:30.270 --> 14:31.550
and more reputable.

14:33.060 --> 14:34.480
But she quit.

14:36.310 --> 14:39.070
Yuzuki is forcing herself
for the sake of everyone else.

14:39.480 --> 14:42.240
How can I be so selfish
and do whatever I want?

14:42.570 --> 14:44.320
You should understand

14:44.320 --> 14:46.530
the difficulties of
inheriting this temple!

14:46.530 --> 14:48.530
Sis Yuzuki is just a high school student.

14:48.530 --> 14:51.800
But she's determined to inherit
the temple and go on marriage interviews!

14:55.620 --> 14:57.210
I can't do it like her.

14:58.040 --> 15:00.000
Yuzuki is really amazing.

15:04.970 --> 15:06.470
In summary,

15:06.470 --> 15:09.850
you think Yuzuki quit the archery club
and she's forcing herself for something,

15:09.850 --> 15:12.270
so you can't just think about
your own happiness, right?

15:13.230 --> 15:15.690
- I've said it several times...
- Come with me.

15:15.690 --> 15:16.980
I have something to show you.

15:17.650 --> 15:18.610
What?

15:25.610 --> 15:26.360
Right here.

15:27.950 --> 15:29.580
Isn't this our temple?

15:29.580 --> 15:31.950
- Yes, right behind the main hall!
- Eh, wait...

15:46.510 --> 15:48.050
How is she...

15:48.640 --> 15:50.680
I want you to understand

15:51.470 --> 15:53.850
whether Yuzuki is really
just struggling in pain

15:53.850 --> 15:56.020
like you said.

15:57.640 --> 15:58.980
Please accept

15:59.440 --> 16:01.980
the real Yuzuki.

16:04.320 --> 16:06.360
No... I don't want to see...

16:06.700 --> 16:08.410
Her face

16:08.820 --> 16:11.910
is still the one I used to admire.

16:28.430 --> 16:30.810
That's the real Yuzuki.

16:31.510 --> 16:36.680
The so-called talent
is just the memories you fabricated.

16:37.430 --> 16:40.400
That's super cool!

16:41.310 --> 16:44.320
I said I didn't want to see it!

16:44.320 --> 16:46.490
Akagami, you're an idiot!

16:46.490 --> 16:49.740
After seeing it, I will want to
return to the archery club!

16:49.740 --> 16:51.320
Calm down, Tsukuyo.

16:51.620 --> 16:53.200
Did you look closely?

16:53.200 --> 16:57.540
What you just saw was
an abled sports idiot.

16:57.540 --> 17:01.500
She practiced archery for over a year,
but still can't master it at all.

17:02.000 --> 17:04.040
I can hear you, Akagami!

17:04.630 --> 17:08.840
I told you I don't have
any talent for archery.

17:08.840 --> 17:10.680
That's why I quit.

17:10.680 --> 17:12.260
Can't be more obvious.

17:12.260 --> 17:14.180
It's okay! Miss Yuzuki!

17:14.180 --> 17:16.010
Your posture is very beautiful,

17:16.010 --> 17:18.600
although there's
nothing else good about it.

17:20.230 --> 17:21.560
Mia, stop talking.

17:22.310 --> 17:25.400
Let me try again!
The last time was just a warm-up!

17:30.360 --> 17:33.370
Ah? Yuzuki's archery skills are very bad.

17:33.870 --> 17:36.580
And she didn't quit the club
because of family reasons.

17:36.580 --> 17:37.580
Really?

17:39.200 --> 17:40.410
You didn't know?

17:40.870 --> 17:43.460
Uh, well...

17:44.000 --> 17:47.420
Tsukuyo is blinded by her
excessive love for her big sister.

17:47.420 --> 17:48.960
Kurage!

17:50.090 --> 17:51.340
What do you mean?

17:51.340 --> 17:55.100
Tsukuyo loves you too much.

17:55.100 --> 17:58.470
She enters that state
as long as she sees you with a bow.

17:58.470 --> 18:01.180
Eh, it makes me shy.
Stop it.

18:01.180 --> 18:03.020
Stop talking.

18:03.480 --> 18:04.980
Anyway! Yuzuki!

18:07.360 --> 18:09.530
Are you happy now?

18:09.860 --> 18:12.990
Yes! I'm happy every day.

18:12.990 --> 18:15.700
The work at the temple is indeed not easy,

18:15.700 --> 18:17.700
but every day is very fulfilling.

18:17.700 --> 18:20.790
I'm wondering if this is
what I really want to do.

18:21.250 --> 18:24.250
So, you should do what you
want to do too, Tsukuyo.

18:24.540 --> 18:26.340
Don't worry about things at home.

18:27.420 --> 18:28.960
There's one more thing.

18:29.840 --> 18:31.210
Could you occasionally

18:31.210 --> 18:34.760
teach me archery?

18:36.300 --> 18:38.560
- Ahahaha!
- Wait, why are you laughing?

18:40.350 --> 18:43.980
Although I think I'm stupid,

18:43.980 --> 18:46.480
I remember a good thing.

18:47.360 --> 18:50.320
Back then, Yuzuki said it with a smile.

18:50.860 --> 18:53.360
I plan to... inherit this temple.

18:58.410 --> 19:00.370
Ah, I've sweated a lot.

19:00.830 --> 19:02.250
I'll go take a shower first.

19:08.790 --> 19:10.750
Sorry, I saw it again...

19:11.460 --> 19:12.920
I'm also very sorry...

19:15.630 --> 19:18.890
We are always so reckless.

19:19.260 --> 19:22.600
I have also done
a lot of rude things to you.

19:23.430 --> 19:24.650
It's okay.

19:26.310 --> 19:28.650
- Hey... Akagami.
- Hmm?

19:28.960 --> 19:31.650
I decided to return to the archery club.

19:32.530 --> 19:35.150
How should I put it...
It's all thanks to you.

19:35.150 --> 19:36.280
Thank you.

19:36.780 --> 19:39.160
Really? That's great.

19:40.330 --> 19:42.160
Akagami,

19:42.990 --> 19:45.120
why did you do this for me?

19:46.670 --> 19:49.250
I just feel that it's not good.

19:50.500 --> 19:54.170
Not being able to do things you want
because of family reasons.

19:55.010 --> 20:00.140
I also gave up a lot
because of the name Akagami.

20:01.970 --> 20:05.350
Is that why you came to this temple?

20:06.770 --> 20:07.980
How should I put it?

20:09.230 --> 20:10.440
I just want

20:11.150 --> 20:14.440
to make you feel happy.

20:18.740 --> 20:20.870
I haven't changed my clothes yet.

20:20.870 --> 20:23.330
Look, this hasn't gone down yet.

20:24.450 --> 20:27.620
The hickey you gave me
in the school infirmary.

20:28.460 --> 20:31.840
How will you take
responsibility this time?

20:31.840 --> 20:34.050
What should I do...

20:34.050 --> 20:35.670
How about doubling your debt?

20:35.670 --> 20:37.130
Please have mercy!

20:37.130 --> 20:39.220
- Alright, stand still.
- Yes.

20:39.840 --> 20:41.260
Close your eyes.

20:57.530 --> 20:58.740
Idiot.

20:59.700 --> 21:01.740
I drew on your forehead.
Let's call it even.

21:02.160 --> 21:03.830
Get dressed quickly.

21:04.780 --> 21:07.080
LEWDMITSU

21:19.380 --> 21:20.260
I'm sorry.

21:23.050 --> 21:26.600
Ah! Tsukuyo forgot to bring lunch again.

21:26.600 --> 21:28.100
I have to send it to her.

21:28.100 --> 21:31.350
Akagami, buy some milk
on the way back.

21:31.350 --> 21:32.480
Understood.

21:34.560 --> 21:35.730
This is new.

21:37.780 --> 21:38.860
Tsukuyo.

21:39.320 --> 21:40.990
You forgot your lunch.

21:41.910 --> 21:42.910
Thank you.

21:44.450 --> 21:46.950
- What's this?
- The love lunch from your boyfriend?

21:46.950 --> 21:48.830
I said I don't have a boyfriend.

21:49.540 --> 21:50.750
He's just...

21:51.460 --> 21:53.120
my family.

21:55.210 --> 21:57.130
- What do you mean?
- Siblings?

21:57.630 --> 21:59.550
Alright, go back quickly.

22:00.090 --> 22:01.630
Ah, okay.

23:44.990 --> 23:47.660
Let's... Let's establish facts.

23:47.660 --> 23:48.950
Indirect kiss?

23:48.950 --> 23:51.700
Only elementary school
students care about that.

23:51.700 --> 23:54.500
Let's... Let's establish facts.

23:54.500 --> 23:55.710
Have you experienced it?

23:55.710 --> 23:58.250
If you don't understand, just shut up.

23:58.250 --> 23:59.920
NEXT EPISODE: LET'S ESTABLISH FACTS!
